.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Physiol%20Behav&amp;title=Rats%20that%20binge%20eat%20fat-rich%20food%20do%20not%20show%20somatic%20signs%20or%20anxiety%20associated%20with%20opiate-like%20withdrawal:%20implications%20for%20nutrient-specific%20food%20addiction%20behaviors&amp;author=ME%20Bocarsly&amp;author=LA%20Berner&amp;author=BG%20Hoebel&amp;author=NM%20Avena&amp;volume=104&amp;publication_year=2011&amp;pages=865-872&amp;pmid=21635910&amp;doi=10.1016/j.physbeh.2011.05.018&amp;\n- https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neubiorev.2007.04.019\n- https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2235907/\n- https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17617461/\n- https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Neurosci%20Biobehav%20Rev&amp;title=Evidence%20for%20sugar%20addiction:%20behavioral%20and%20neurochemical%20effects%20of%20intermittent,%20excessive%20sugar%20intake&amp;author=NM%20Avena&amp;author=P%20Rada&amp;author=BG%20Hoebel&amp;volume=32&amp;publication_year=2008&amp;pages=20-39&amp;pmid=17617461&amp;doi=10.1016/j.neubiorev.2007.04.019&amp;\n- https://doi.org/10.1038/nn.2519\n- https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2947358/\n- https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/20348917/\n- https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Nat%20Neurosci&amp;title=Dopamine%20D2%20receptors%20in%20addiction-like%20reward%20dysfunction%20and%20compulsive%20eating%20in%20obese%20rats&amp;author=PM%20Johnson&amp;author=PJ%20Kenny&amp;volume=13&amp;publication_year=2010&amp;pages=635-641&amp;pmid=20348917&amp;doi=10.1038/nn.2519&amp;\n- https://doi.org/10.2174/1874473711104030140\n- https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21999688/\n- https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Curr%20Drug%20Abuse%20Rev&amp;title=The%20addiction%20potential%20of%20hyperpalatable%20foods&amp;author=A%20Gearhardt&amp;author=C%20Davis&amp;author=R%20Kuschner&amp;author=K%20Brownell&amp;volume=4&amp;publication_year=2011&amp;pages=140-145&amp;pmid=21999688&amp;doi=10.2174/1874473711104030140&amp;\n- https://doi.org/10.1016/j